{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type ResetFn<TFormData> = (values?, opts?) => void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L618","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:618"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resets form values, metadata, validation state, and mounted fields."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Calling without values restores the current "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultValues"},{"type":"text","value":". Supplying\nvalues sets the current values and also updates "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultValues"},{"type":"text","value":" to those\nvalues. This can apply expected values immediately while fresh data is\nfetched from the backend."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Results from validation or submission work pending at reset are discarded."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tformdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFormData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"values","children":[{"type":"text","value":"values?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Values to apply, or omit to restore "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultValues"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts","children":[{"type":"text","value":"opts?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/FormResetOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormResetOptions"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options controlling whether supplied values replace\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultValues"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"values","text":"values?","level":3},{"id":"opts","text":"opts?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ResetFn<TFormData> = (values?, opts?) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:618](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L618)\n\nResets form values, metadata, validation state, and mounted fields.\n\nCalling without values restores the current `defaultValues`. Supplying\nvalues sets the current values and also updates `defaultValues` to those\nvalues. This can apply expected values immediately while fresh data is\nfetched from the backend.\n\nResults from validation or submission work pending at reset are discarded.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### values?\n\n`TFormData`\n\nValues to apply, or omit to restore `defaultValues`.\n\n### opts?\n\n[`FormResetOptions`](../interfaces/FormResetOptions.md)\n\nOptions controlling whether supplied values replace\n`defaultValues`.\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ResetFn\ntitle: ResetFn\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ResetFn<TFormData> = (values?, opts?) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:618](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L618)\n\nResets form values, metadata, validation state, and mounted fields.\n\nCalling without values restores the current `defaultValues`. Supplying\nvalues sets the current values and also updates `defaultValues` to those\nvalues. This can apply expected values immediately while fresh data is\nfetched from the backend.\n\nResults from validation or submission work pending at reset are discarded.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### values?\n\n`TFormData`\n\nValues to apply, or omit to restore `defaultValues`.\n\n### opts?\n\n[`FormResetOptions`](../interfaces/FormResetOptions.md)\n\nOptions controlling whether supplied values replace\n`defaultValues`.\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
